{"parse":{"title":"Victory Flows from the Turning of Tides","pageid":409008,"revid":2042438,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Victory Flows from the Turning of Tides</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Victory_Flows_from_the_Turning_of_Tides.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045641\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Victory Flows from the Turning of Tides\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Victory_Flows_from_the_Turning_of_Tides.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045641\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Victory_Flows_from_the_Turning_of_Tides.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045641 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Victory_Flows_from_the_Turning_of_Tides.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045641 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Victory Flows from the Turning of Tides\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Victory_Flows_from_the_Turning_of_Tides.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Victory Flows from the Turning of Tides.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Hides_in_the_Margins\" title=\"Opportunity Hides in the Margins\">Opportunity Hides in the Margins</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Nefer unleashes <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Phantasm Performance</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Phantasm Performance</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When in the Shadow Dance state caused by her Elemental Skill Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights, if you have at least 1 Verdant Dew, Nefer's Charged Attacks will be replaced with the special Charged Attack Phantasm Performance, which will not consume Stamina.<br />Nefer summons shades of herself to perform Coordinated Attacks against enemies. Nefer and the shades will deal 2 and 3 stages of <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>AoE Dendro DMG</b></span> respectively. DMG dealt by the shades is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG. 1 Verdant Dew will be consumed the first time shades are summoned after every Phantasm Performance.</span></span></span>, the second stage of DMG dealt by herself will be converted to deal <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>AoE Dendro DMG</b></span> equal to 85% of her <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a>. Additionally, when the attacks from Phantasm Performance end, an extra instance of <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>AoE Dendro DMG</b></span> equal to 120% of Nefer's Elemental Mastery will be dealt. All of the aforementioned DMG is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG dealt by Phantasm Performance.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b><br />Nefer's Lunar-Bloom DMG is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>elevated</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 15%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Direct_Lunar-Bloom\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Direct Lunar-Bloom\">Direct Lunar-Bloom</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DMG Elevation\">DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Victory Flows from the Turning of Tides</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_6_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 6 Constellation\">Level 6 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced_Properties\">Advanced Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVictory_Flows_from_the_Turning_of_Tides%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable thc tdl\" style=\"min-width:600px\">\n<tbody><tr><th rowspan=\"2\"></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Gauge_Theory\" title=\"Elemental Gauge Theory\">Gauge<br />Units</a></th><th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Internal_Cooldown\" title=\"Internal Cooldown\">Internal Cooldown</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance\" title=\"Interruption Resistance\">Poise<br />Damage</a></th><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance/Stagger\" title=\"Interruption Resistance/Stagger\">Stagger Effect</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blunt_Attack\" title=\"Blunt Attack\">Blunt</a></th></tr><tr><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Tag\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Tag</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Type\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Type</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"S. L.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">S. L.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Stagger Level</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"H. F.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">H. F.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Horizontal Force</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"V. F.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">V. F.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Vertical Force</span></span>&#8205;</th></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">Converted Phantasm Performance 2-Hit DMG (Nefer)</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/wiki/0U\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"0U\">0U</a></td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left\">No ICD</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">30</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Heavy</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">240</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><span class=\"check-no\" data-sort-value=\"3\" title=\"No\">&#10008;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">Extra Lunar-Bloom DMG</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/wiki/0U\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"0U\">0U</a></td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left\">No ICD</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">30</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Heavy</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">140</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><span class=\"check-no\" data-sort-value=\"3\" title=\"No\">&#10008;</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a titl